oy in ways that feel more suitable for you. Maintaining an open mind about different experiences while also honoring your feelings of discomfort can lead to discovering your true interests. After all, the journey to finding an activity you love is as important as the activity itself. Every experience adds to your understanding of what you truly enjoy, and that’s a valuable insight!"], "document_offset": 0, "logical_document_count": 4, "physical_batch_limit": 4, "score_contract": "pointwise", "score_space": "unit_interval", "sequence": 47, "elapsed_seconds": 0.012726068496704102}
